# The public control-plane image needs only its checked-in control-plane
# package and the local packages it resolves through path dependencies, plus
# license/notice files. Keeping deployment, device-build, and evidence trees
# out of the context prevents unrelated material from entering the image
# build.
*
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!dashboard/
!dashboard/**
!packages/
!packages/patch_format/
!packages/patch_format/**
!packages/runtime/
!packages/runtime/**
!packages/control_plane/
!packages/control_plane/**
!experiments/
!experiments/instrumentation/
!experiments/instrumentation/**
!experiments/patch_loading/
!experiments/patch_loading/**

# Keep generated Dart/build evidence out of the context even when a required
# source tree contains it locally.
**/.dart_tool/
**/.dart_tool/**
**/build/
**/build/**
**/coverage/
**/coverage/**
**/*.log
